{"v":4,"catch":"開始一場偉大的冒險，幫助東戈逃離危險的敵人和充滿挑戰的環境！","desc":"Dongo Adventure 是一款 3D 平台風格的遊戲，主角（Dongo）一隻老鼠，在各種場景（下水道、房屋、湖泊、工廠等）中冒險，沿途面對幾個敵人（蟑螂、蚊子、青蛙、蜘蛛、有毒氣體、電線等）。他背著一個裝有奶酪的背包，用來投擲和保護自己免受敵人的攻擊，此外還能夠推動幫助他通過障礙和解決難題的物體。最終目標將是一個驚喜！","publisher":"QUByte Interactive","release":"2021-09-02","genres":["街機","動作","冒險","其他"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["英文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.3GB / Switch 0.3GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/e371cefe456ae32d0fb7a59d28acdf0654349708161ac3f8ce6219be63a298c1.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/ef0b9d7449767d1f9aa1d7c94bc2cb87692f92549d1a92b7a7d07339bcb9871a.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/898853fcad3d0eada44e87e3b68e95447bd1385d3af0b55b33e6aef71f399155.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/9636b0d9ecd6f392f5680c8cc9c7ec34c2ca26cc0d55e815f90cfd492b8c3a99.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/4089915648e96523e8817eea33fa193b9c1aa85e51f07b8c8d258c4681ed22b1.jpg"],"titleId":"010088b010dd2000","dlc":[]}